    {
     "id": "ch001-d0004",
     "text": "Well!"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch002-d0005",
     "text": "They must go by the carrier,"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch002-d0036",
     "text": "Où est ma chatte?"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch002-d0044",
     "text": "We won't talk about her any more if you'd rather not."
    },
    {
     "id": "ch003-d0018",
     "text": "it doesn't seem to dry me at all."
    },
    {
     "id": "ch003-d0041",
     "text": "You promised to tell me your history, you know,"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch003-d0053",
     "text": "Oh, do let me help to undo it!"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch003-d0065",
     "text": "She'd soon fetch it back!"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch004-d0003",
     "text": "He took me for his housemaid, How surprised he'll be when he finds out who I am! But I'd better take him his fan and gloves—that is, if I can find them."
    },
    {
     "id": "ch004-d0008",
     "text": "Now I can do no more, whatever happens. What will become of me?"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch004-d0029",
     "text": "This is Bill,"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch004-d0033",
     "text": "That's Bill,"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch006-d0035",
     "text": "If I don't take this child away with me, they're sure to kill it in a day or two: wouldn't it be murder to leave it behind?"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch006-d0042",
     "text": "Cheshire Puss,"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch006-d0062",
     "text": "I should like it very much, but I haven't been invited yet."
    },
    {
     "id": "ch006-d0065",
     "text": "It turned into a pig,"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch006-d0072",
     "text": "Suppose it should be raving mad after all! I almost wish I'd gone to see the Hatter instead!"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch007-d0016",
     "text": "Exactly so,"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch007-d0053",
     "text": "I've heard something like it,"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch007-d0075",
     "text": "They couldn't have done that, you know, they'd have been ill."
    },
    {
     "id": "ch007-d0105",
     "text": "Now, I'll manage better this time,"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch009-d0006",
     "text": "The game's going on rather better now,"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch009-d0008",
     "text": "Somebody said, that it's done by everybody minding their own business!"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch009-d0010",
     "text": "How fond she is of finding morals in things!"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch009-d0012",
     "text": "He might bite,"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch009-d0068",
     "text": "You couldn't have wanted it much, living at the bottom of the sea."
    },
    {
     "id": "ch009-d0087",
     "text": "Then the eleventh day must have been a holiday?"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch010-d0005",
     "text": "I once tasted—"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch010-d0043",
     "text": "Does the boots and shoes!"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch010-d0051",
     "text": "Wouldn't it really?"
    },
    {
     "id": "ch010-d0072",
     "text": "It's the first position in dancing."
    },
    {
     "id": "ch011-d0002",
     "text": "That's the judge, because of his great wig."
    },
    {
     "id": "ch011-d0004",
     "text": "What are they doing? They can't have anything to put down yet, before the trial's begun."
    },
    {
     "id": "ch011-d0006",
     "text": "Stupid things!"
    }
   ]
